        "addedPatches": {
          "0007-android-cross-rust-crates.patch": "Upstream deps/crates sets a Rust target only for Windows and macOS. Android cross builds need the target triple for libnode and a separate Linux host triple for mksnapshot (i686 for ARMv7, x86_64 otherwise).",
          "0008-android-cross-host-libatomic.patch": "Upstream node.gyp links -latomic only when OS is linux. In Android cross builds the host tool node_js2c links simdutf, whose atomic base64 helpers call __atomic_load/__atomic_store on the 32-bit x86 host used for ARMv7. The patch adds -latomic to host-toolset links only; target link commands are unchanged."
